WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.632
By the end of this module, you should be able to explain when distributed processing is useful,

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:13.962
describe the basic Spark execution model, and understand how Spark S Q L and data frames connect.

00:00:13.962 --> 00:00:23.732
You should also be able to reason about lakehouse tables, schema choices, Delta tables, query plans, partitions,

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.632
and shuffles at an introductory level.

00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:31.571
The goal is practical understanding, not cluster administration.
